# 5. Independent Test: Flavor Mixing

The framework was compared against measured flavor mixing.

## Neutrinos

The PMNS matrix exhibits large mixing among generations. 【2-e346e4】【3-1daf17】

## Quarks

The CKM matrix exhibits comparatively small mixing. 【3-1daf17】【4-5da0c6】

This suggests:

```text
Identity-Dominated Families
        ↓
   High Mixing

Differentiation-Dominated Families
        ↓
   Low Mixing
```

The observed PMNS–CKM contrast is consistent with this ordering.

